{
  "format": "gravitas.navigation-inventory/1",
  "note": "The navigation model (NAVIGATION.md), the mapping of every surface into it, the ceilings the structural checks hold the site to, and the checks it fails today by design. tests/navigationChecks.test.js and e2e/navigation.spec.js read this file. A ceiling is lowered by the prompt that earns it; raising one needs a decision-register row. Nothing here is a user study: it proves structure, labels and reachability, not comprehension.",
